  PMSP.credit_keep cr cr4 (PNRNA.pot_runA L ar s sa) (PNRNA.pot_runA L ar s4 sa) ->
  srealizes RSEGS SCFG (@PMSP.cfg RSEGS fx4 R4 0xd3028 M4 model4) K.
